92
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:35,726
Hello, everyone. I am
Chenle from NCT DREAM.

93
00:03:35,750 --> 00:03:37,960
Hello, everyone. I am
Chenle from NCT DREAM.

94
00:03:38,020 --> 00:03:42,760
