107
00:04:11,820 --> 00:04:13,830
Hello, everyone. My name is Tsuki.

108
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:16,230
I came from Osaka. Hello, I am Tsuki.

109
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,360
I came from Osaka.

110
