146
00:05:44,620 --> 00:05:47,520
Here, you can just think of
this as a casual food talk show...

147
00:05:47,820 --> 00:05:49,249
where we comfortably chat
about food from our hometowns,

148
00:05:49,250 --> 00:05:52,089
favorite Korean dishes,

149
00:05:52,090 --> 00:05:55,189
or anything related to
K-FOOD. We'll talk about it.

150
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:57,560
Think of this as a casual food talk show.

151
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,100
What a great collaboration.

152
00:05:59,300 --> 00:06:02,870
Regardless of nationality or
age, united by delicious food,

153
00:06:02,930 --> 00:06:05,500
