154
00:06:07,910 --> 00:06:09,110
I love that.

155
00:06:09,510 --> 00:06:11,630
An essential rite of passage
to becoming true family.

156
00:06:11,710 --> 00:06:14,510
- It's the Family Table.
- I gave everyone...

157
00:06:14,610 --> 00:06:16,710
