To draw a picture.

158
00:06:16,780 --> 00:06:17,896
(Drawing Food Memories, "Family Table")

159
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,120
Family Table.

160
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,389
I'm going to express a food...

161
00:06:21,390 --> 00:06:23,090
