162
00:06:23,190 --> 00:06:25,290
Will anyone recognize it?

163
00:06:25,390 --> 00:06:26,436
You'll see once you look at it.

164
00:06:26,460 --> 00:06:28,390
(What kind of dishes were drawn?)

165
00:06:28,490 --> 00:06:30,336
Shall we start with the
eldest brother, BamBam?

166
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,000
- Sounds good. - Good.

167
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:33,300
- All right. - Sounds good.

168
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:36,100
