169
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:37,300
Ta-da.

170
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:40,300
- Goodness. - You drew this so well.

171
00:06:40,940 --> 00:06:42,810
- Amazing. - It actually looks like food.

172
00:06:42,910 --> 00:06:44,110
