174
00:06:49,010 --> 00:06:50,379
- On the top right, yes. - This?

175
00:06:50,380 --> 00:06:52,150
- Is that gimbap? Gimbap. - Wrong.

176
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:54,850
- Pork Gomtang.
- Pork Gomtang. You are close.

177
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:57,020
- Pork Gukbap. - Pork Gukbap?

178
00:06:57,090 --> 00:06:58,490
That is right. Pork Gukbap.

179
00:07:00,290 --> 00:07:02,389
The Korean food that
represents me is Pork Gukbap.

180
00:07:02,390 --> 00:07:04,430
- Pork Gukbap. - Yes.

181
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:08,830
