chewy texture of pig ears.

186
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:20,210
- Really? - Ears.

187
00:07:21,510 --> 00:07:24,449
It is a dish that nicely
captures different sides of me.

188
00:07:24,450 --> 00:07:26,050
- I see. - Right.

189
00:07:26,220 --> 00:07:30,019
On your table, is there a
food that you often look for...

190
00:07:30,020 --> 00:07:31,466
