191
00:07:31,490 --> 00:07:32,850
That would be this one right here.

192
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:33,960
Isn't that gimbap?

193
00:07:34,590 --> 00:07:36,590
- What is it? - Grilled pork belly.

194
00:07:36,890 --> 00:07:39,660
- It is pork belly, but...
- Is that water dropwort?

195
00:07:39,730 --> 00:07:44,270
Correct. I really, really love
pork belly with water dropwort.

196
00:07:44,340 --> 00:07:46,539
For me, pork belly has to be...

197
00:07:46,540 --> 00:07:47,586
- thinly sliced. - You know how to eat.

198
00:07:47,610 --> 00:07:49,386
Yes. Thinly sliced pork
belly with water dropwort.

199
00:07:49,410 --> 00:07:51,116
And it has to be frozen,
thinly sliced pork belly.

200
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:53,040
- This... - The thin kind.

201
00:07:53,110 --> 00:07:54,110
Right.

202
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:56,879
No, but looking at what you are wearing,

203
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:58,820
BamBam looks so fancy today,

204
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:04,590
