380
00:14:17,830 --> 00:14:18,830
You were totally hooked.

381
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:21,470
Yes. The meat tucked between the bones.

382
00:14:21,870 --> 00:14:23,106
Picking out that meat is the best part.

383
00:14:23,130 --> 00:14:24,370
You cannot waste a single bit.

384
00:14:24,670 --> 00:14:25,846
You have to suck it completely clean.

385
00:14:25,870 --> 00:14:28,470
I make sure to strip
off every single piece...

386
00:14:29,270 --> 00:14:31,440
