you make fried rice.

392
00:14:44,490 --> 00:14:45,990
That is so...

393
00:14:46,060 --> 00:14:47,096
Letting the rice get crispy.

394
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:48,736
- Yes, exactly. The crispy rice.
- The crispy rice.

395
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:50,930
