00:38:31,010 --> 00:38:34,820
(Chenle takes a mouthful.)

1004
00:38:35,990 --> 00:38:39,590
(Using Both Hands)

1005
00:38:39,890 --> 00:38:43,790
(Chenle clears the Braised Kimchi.)

1006
00:38:43,890 --> 00:38:47,100
