1007
00:38:47,700 --> 00:38:51,200
(Carmen takes a big, satisfying bite too.)

1008
00:38:51,800 --> 00:38:53,100
(Savoring)

1009
00:38:53,500 --> 00:38:56,110
(It is so good. I can't stop eating.)

1010
00:38:56,510 --> 00:38:59,140
(Having a bite)

1011
00:39:01,510 --> 00:39:03,980
- This is so delicious.
- This is really good.

1012
00:39:05,380 --> 00:39:07,080
(The chef is nervous.)

1013
00:39:07,480 --> 00:39:09,650
- It's really delicious.
- It's really good.

1014
00:39:09,720 --> 00:39:12,390
I've ordered Braised
Kimchi so many times before,

1015
00:39:12,890 --> 00:39:14,590
