1017
00:39:15,730 --> 00:39:18,190
It's really good. I'm crying tears of joy.

1018
00:39:19,300 --> 00:39:20,960
(What a relief.)

1019
00:39:21,300 --> 00:39:24,900
(Finally, he takes a spoonful at ease.)

1020
00:39:26,000 --> 00:39:27,699
