also spicy, - I see.

1102
00:42:41,760 --> 00:42:44,730
So it's great to eat with
rice, and with tomatoes...

1103
00:42:45,430 --> 00:42:48,570
(He takes a spoonful
after adding the hot sauce.)

1104
00:42:49,200 --> 00:42:52,810
(Eun Ji tries it too.)

1105
00:42:53,480 --> 00:42:55,040
Hot sauce on Stir-fried Tomato and Egg?

1106
00:42:55,980 --> 00:42:59,480
- How is it? - It's surprisingly charming.

1107
00:42:59,650 --> 00:43:00,756
But this hot sauce is really spicy.

1108
00:43:00,780 --> 00:43:04,390
- I like it.
- The spiciness really hits you.

1109
00:43:05,020 --> 00:43:06,120
- Really? - Yes.

1110
00:43:06,190 --> 00:43:07,636
This is very spicy. Just have a little.

1111
00:43:07,660 --> 00:43:09,260
- It's really spicy. - It's super spicy.

1112
00:43:10,060 --> 00:43:11,936
What is this? How high is
this on the Scoville scale?

1113
00:43:11,960 --> 00:43:13,930
- I don't know. - Is it that spicy?

1114
00:43:14,560 --> 00:43:15,660
It must be a spicy sauce.

1115
00:43:17,070 --> 00:43:19,600
