now because it's so spicy.

1116
00:43:20,470 --> 00:43:21,470
- My gosh. - Cute.

1117
00:43:23,040 --> 00:43:24,086
Let me try drizzling some too.

1118
00:43:24,110 --> 00:43:26,409
- Hey, this is really spicy.
- You'll be in big trouble.

1119
00:43:26,410 --> 00:43:27,980
- It's really spicy. - You'll die.

1120
00:43:28,040 --> 00:43:29,909
- I'll die? - Yes. Go ahead, try it.

1121
00:43:29,910 --> 00:43:31,950
(Chenle warns him, but
Jaemin tries the hot sauce.)

1122
00:43:34,520 --> 00:43:35,990
My palate has been well trained...

1123
