1129
00:43:50,270 --> 00:43:51,270
It's so spicy.

1130
00:43:51,970 --> 00:43:53,416
I only added a little, but it's spicy.

1131
00:43:53,440 --> 00:43:56,170
(Everyone is trying to calm down.)

1132
00:43:56,570 --> 00:43:58,070
