1140
00:44:21,660 --> 00:44:22,870
That's satay sauce.

1141
00:44:23,600 --> 00:44:24,600
I'll try some.

1142
00:44:25,300 --> 00:44:26,300
Go ahead.

1143
00:44:26,970 --> 00:44:28,239
Right when it's spicy like this,

1144
00:44:28,240 --> 00:44:29,910
