1145
00:44:31,310 --> 00:44:32,840
- Does it go well? - Is it good?

1146
00:44:33,180 --> 00:44:35,410
Really? Now I'm curious too.

1147
00:44:36,180 --> 00:44:37,180
I want to try it.

1148
00:44:37,780 --> 00:44:39,420
I think it'll make it taste a bit creamy.

1149
00:44:40,620 --> 00:44:42,220
I think mixing a little bit of this...

1150
00:44:42,280 --> 00:44:43,426
