1151
00:44:43,450 --> 00:44:44,450
That sounds delicious.

1152
00:44:45,050 --> 00:44:46,259
This is incredible.

1153
00:44:46,260 --> 00:44:49,560
(He tries it after mixing it with rice.)

1154
00:44:50,630 --> 00:44:53,630
(Slurping)

1155
00:44:54,630 --> 00:44:56,500
- It's so good. - This really is delicious.

1156
00:44:57,270 --> 00:44:58,590
Satay sauce goes great with this.

1157
00:44:59,270 --> 00:45:02,270
Serving a whole meal like this...

1158
00:45:02,770 --> 00:45:07,040
