Korea would be wonderful.

1159
00:45:07,110 --> 00:45:08,710
- That's right. - A feast like this.

1160
00:45:08,880 --> 00:45:10,650
Yes, that's why I did it,

1161
00:45:10,710 --> 00:45:13,110
