00:45:50,820 --> 00:45:51,820
Awesome. In that case,

1178
00:45:51,890 --> 00:45:55,320
Jaemin's Savory Braised Kimchi DREAM.

1179
00:45:55,860 --> 00:45:58,790
And Chenle's Stir-fried
